// Sump-slick action — a jury-rigged fast action: scales the reload cost down (a faster, if
// smaller, speed-up than a dedicated speed-loader). Data-driven attachment ITEM (the
// grimdark "SumpSlickAction" tag). The magnitude lives HERE on the item (not a global
// tuning factor). Applied post-spawn. (An older tag also added base spread; that
// sloppier-cone coupling is USER-REVIEW — the shipped default is the reload speed-up alone.)
(
    display_name: "Sump-Slick Action",
    slot: Rail,  // a jury-rigged action kit bolted to the utility rail — the Rail slot
    effects: [
        ReloadTime(0.7),  // ×0.7 the weapon's reload_tu (< 1 = faster) — tunable
    ],
)
